<title>UK: IADB sets 10 billion yen three-year bond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets 10 billion yen three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON    *5.75	MATURITY    30.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.5375   PAY DATE  S-01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1875    REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAYABLE IN YEN, REDEMPTION IN AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
